--- !u!114 &236971199
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 236971196}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a3ae53b6d61cb248b10a369773eeb64, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogManager: {fileID: 358995790}
  playerController: {fileID: 865685251}
  wishCarrier: {fileID: 0}
  message: '...Oh. | It''s you. | Did you need something or. | Actually don''t answer
    that, I''m busy. | Well I''m not busy but I was thinking about being busy so
    same thing.

'
  WorldPeace: Mm. | Good for the world I guess. | Can you move? | You're blocking
    the window. | I was looking at nothing but it was MY nothing.
  Money: Hi. | Hello. | I feel like we never talk enough, like ever. | We should
    fix that. | Actually you know what, let's just be together. | I've thought about
    it for a long time. | Like since just now. | But still.
  Relationships: You're taken? | ...Good for you. | Whatever. | I didn't ask. | I
    wasn't going to ask. | I was going to ask something completely different actually.
    | Forget it.
  Accomplished: I heard your name going around. | Interesting. | Very interesting.
    | So what are you doing later. | Not that I have plans I just want to know yours.
    | For no reason.
  MoreWishes: 
  Immortality: 
  Nothing: 
  WorldPeace_Money: Everyone loves you and I just want to say | I loved you first.
    | Recently but still first. | Right after the news segment actually. | Almost
    during it. | I was very fast about it.
  WorldPeace_Relationships: People like you now. | A lot of people. | And you're
    with someone. | Cool. | That's cool. | Totally cool. | I'm cool about it. | Very
    cool. | So cool.
  WorldPeace_Accomplished: You're everywhere lately. | I saw you on two channels
    last night. | I wasn't looking for you. | I just happened to see it. | Twice.
    | Back to back. | I didn't change the channel fast enough. | Twice.
  WorldPeace_MoreWishes: 
  WorldPeace_Immortality: 
  Money_Relationships: ' Hi! | I saw you on the news again last night. | You looked
    amazing. | We looked amazing. | I was in the background but still. | We''re a
    great couple. | Everyone says so. | I bring it up actually. | Frequently.'
  Money_Accomplished: There he is! | MY boyfriend. | The successful one. | I tell
    everyone. | Strangers mostly. | The cashier at the grocery store knows your net
    worth because of me. | She seemed impressed. | I made sure she seemed impressed.
  Money_MoreWishes: 
  Money_Immortality: 
  Relationships_Accomplished: Famous, rich, loved by all, AND taken by me. | I feel
    like I won something. | Did I win something? | It feels like I won something.
    | I should get a trophy. | A small one is fine. | Actually make it big.
  Relationships_MoreWishes: 
  Relationships_Immortality: 
  Accomplished_MoreWishes: 
  Accomplished_Immortality: 
  MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  WorldPeace_Money_Relationships: The whole world loves you and you chose ME specifically.
    | Out of everyone. | I think about that a lot. | Like a normal amount. | Maybe
    slightly above normal. | It's fine. | You're lucky honestly. | We're both lucky.
    | Mostly you.
  WorldPeace_Money_Accomplished: Famous, rich, loved by all, AND taken by me. | I
    feel like I won something. | Did I win something? | It feels like I won something.
    | I should get a trophy. | A small one is fine. | Actually make it big.
  WorldPeace_Money_MoreWishes: 
  WorldPeace_Money_Immortality: 
  WorldPeace_Relationships_Accomplished: Everyone loves you, you have a career, AND
    a partner. | Good. | Great. | Wonderful. | I have to go. | I don't have to go.
    | I just need a second. | Give me a second.
  WorldPeace_Relationships_MoreWishes: 
  WorldPeace_Relationships_Immortality: 
  WorldPeace_Accomplished_MoreWishes: 
  WorldPeace_Accomplished_Immortality: 
  WorldPeace_MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  Money_Relationships_Accomplished: Rich, successful, AND mine. | I did good didn't
    I. | I really picked well. | I picked so well. | Everyone thinks so. | I asked
    them. | Multiple people. | They all said yes. | I may have phrased the question
    in a leading way but the answers were still yes.
  Money_Relationships_MoreWishes: 
  Money_Relationships_Immortality: 
  Money_Accomplished_MoreWishes: 
  Money_Accomplished_Immortality: 
  Money_MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  Relationships_Accomplished_MoreWishes: 
  Relationships_Accomplished_Immortality: 
  Relationships_MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  Accomplished_MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  playerTag: Player
  InteractionPrompt: {fileID: 1294335490}
  npcName: Connie
