--- !u!114 &319765774
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 319765771}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a3ae53b6d61cb248b10a369773eeb64, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogManager: {fileID: 358995790}
  playerController: {fileID: 865685251}
  wishCarrier: {fileID: 0}
  message: Yeah, yeah, keep moving. | I've got enough people standing around doing
    nothing already | ...
  WorldPeace: Hm. | World's been weirdly calm lately. | Don't see what the big deal
    is. | Get back to work.
  Money: Oh. | Hey! | Didn't see you there buddy! | Looking good lately, really good.
    | We should catch up sometime!
  Relationships: You have a date tonight? | Yeah I'm gonna need you to stay late
    actually. | Important stuff. | You understand. | Great.
  Accomplished: I saw your name going around. | Not bad. | I mean I could've done
    it better but... | Hey, lunch is on me today!
  MoreWishes: 
  Immortality: 
  Nothing: 
  WorldPeace_Money: Everyone's been talking about you! | Which is great, really great.
    | Hey, can you introduce me to some of those people? | Just casually.
  WorldPeace_Relationships: People really like you lately. | Your partner too I assume.
    | Anyway I cancelled your Friday afternoon, we have a team thing. | You're welcome.
  WorldPeace_Accomplished: Three news mentions last week? | Impressive. | You know
    I gave you that opportunity originally right? | Just want that on record.
  WorldPeace_MoreWishes: 
  WorldPeace_Immortality: 
  Money_Relationships: Hey champ! | Quick thing, your partner called the office earlier.
    | I told them you'd be home late. | You're welcome. | Big meeting tomorrow anyway.
  Money_Accomplished: Listen, I was thinking. | You and me, we should partner up
    on something. | I've always believed in you, you know that. | Since day one actually.
  Money_MoreWishes: 
  Money_Immortality: 
  Relationships_Accomplished: Promotion AND a partner? | Cute. | Hey, date night
    might have to wait, I need those files by Friday. | She'll understand. | Probably.
  Relationships_MoreWishes: 
  Relationships_Immortality: 
  Accomplished_MoreWishes: 
  Accomplished_Immortality: 
  MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  WorldPeace_Money_Relationships: You're basically famous now! | I knew it! | I SAID
    it! | Ask anyone! | Hey, your partner's great by the way, very patient. | Very.
  WorldPeace_Money_Accomplished: People are calling YOU now? | That's... great. |
    Really great. | Hey, remember when I gave you that feedback that one time? |
    Shaped you, probably.
  WorldPeace_Money_MoreWishes: 
  WorldPeace_Money_Immortality: 
  WorldPeace_Relationships_Accomplished: Everyone loves you, you're doing great,
    AND someone chose you? | I mean I saw potential in you before any of this obviously.
    | Obviously.
  WorldPeace_Relationships_MoreWishes: 
  WorldPeace_Relationships_Immortality: 
  WorldPeace_Accomplished_MoreWishes: 
  WorldPeace_Accomplished_Immortality: 
  WorldPeace_MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  Money_Relationships_Accomplished: Wow. | Just wow. | Hey, I told my wife I know
    you personally. | She didn't believe me. | Dinner at yours sometime? | Just an
    idea.
  Money_Relationships_MoreWishes: 
  Money_Relationships_Immortality: 
  Money_Accomplished_MoreWishes: 
  Money_Accomplished_Immortality: 
  Money_MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  Relationships_Accomplished_MoreWishes: 
  Relationships_Accomplished_Immortality: 
  Relationships_MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  Accomplished_MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  playerTag: Player
  InteractionPrompt: {fileID: 334072813}
  npcName: Jullio
