--- !u!114 &1615279976
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1615279972}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a3ae53b6d61cb248b10a369773eeb64, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogManager: {fileID: 358995790}
  playerController: {fileID: 865685251}
  wishCarrier: {fileID: 0}
  message: Hi, im bill | Are you new around here
  WorldPeace: I was watching the news this morning and apparently tension rates are
    at an all time low! | Fascinating stuff really. | I made a chart about it.
  Money: Hey, I saw you on the news last night! | Listen, we should totally grab
    lunch sometime! | I've always liked you, you know that right?
  Relationships: Oh you seem... happy lately. | Good for you I guess. | Anyway did
    you fill out the Q3 report yet?
  Accomplished: Oh wow, page 47 of the industry report! | Hey, you think you could
    put in a good word for me upstairs? | We're basically best friends at this point!
  MoreWishes: 
  Immortality: 
  Nothing: 
  WorldPeace_Money: Everyone's been saying great things about you lately! | I've
    always said it too, just so you know. | Always. | Ask anyone.
  WorldPeace_Relationships: ' I ran a quick survey. | Statistically you''re the most
    liked person in the building. | I''m number 111! | out of 112...'
  WorldPeace_Accomplished: I saw you on THREE separate news channels last night.
    | THREE. | I have them recorded if you want to watch. | I made popcorn.
  WorldPeace_MoreWishes: 
  WorldPeace_Immortality: 
  Money_Relationships: You were on the news AND you've got a partner now? | Living
    the dream man. | Meanwhile I'm still eating sad desk salads alone. | Ha. | Ha.
  Money_Accomplished: Okay so I may have made a spreadsheet tracking your career
    trajectory. | It's color coded. | Blue is impressive. | It's very blue.
  Money_MoreWishes: 
  Money_Immortality: 
  Relationships_Accomplished: You got the promotion AND someone who puts up with
    you? | Strange
  Relationships_MoreWishes: 
  Relationships_Immortality: 
  Accomplished_MoreWishes: 
  Accomplished_Immortality: 
  MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  WorldPeace_Money_Relationships: The whole world loves you AND you're doing great
    financially AND you have a partner?! | I need to study you. | Scientifically.
    | For research.
  WorldPeace_Money_Accomplished: You're basically a case study at this point. | I
    emailed my old professor about you. | He said it sounds fake.
  WorldPeace_Money_MoreWishes: 
  WorldPeace_Money_Immortality: 
  WorldPeace_Relationships_Accomplished: "  Everyone loves you | yet they don\u2019t
    seem to know you  | Wild. | Genuinely wild. | I'm taking notes."
  WorldPeace_Relationships_MoreWishes: 
  WorldPeace_Relationships_Immortality: 
  WorldPeace_Accomplished_MoreWishes: 
  WorldPeace_Accomplished_Immortality: 
  WorldPeace_MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  Money_Relationships_Accomplished: Rich, respected, and someone actually likes you.
    | I've modeled this scenario in Excel before. | Didn't think it was real. | Huh.
  Money_Relationships_MoreWishes: 
  Money_Relationships_Immortality: 
  Money_Accomplished_MoreWishes: 
  Money_Accomplished_Immortality: 
  Money_MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  Relationships_Accomplished_MoreWishes: 
  Relationships_Accomplished_Immortality: 
  Relationships_MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  Accomplished_MoreWishes_Immortality: 
  playerTag: Player
  InteractionPrompt: {fileID: 1887307708}
  npcName: Billy
